<title>HONG KONG: Deson Development debuts at HK$1.20/shr.</title>
<headline>Deson Development debuts at HK$1.20/shr.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Deson Development International Holdings Ltd made their trading debut at HK$1.20 per share on Tuesday, compared with an issue price of HK$1.00.</p>
